n_syntax": "passed_22_of_22", "java_compile": "failed_30_of_73"}, "java_failure_summary": {"total_failures": 30, "missing_genspark_assignment_dependency_files": 29, "other_missing_dependency_files": ["genSpark/section5/CountDuplicatesWithMap.java also imports it.unimi.dsi.fastutil.Hash"], "class_filename_mismatch_files": ["leetCode/ValidBrackets.java declares public class algo, so javac expects algo.java"]}, "proposed_fix_pbis": [{"title": "Add or document GenSpark Java assignment dependency setup for algos", "details": "29 GenSpark section5/section7 Java exercises import genspark.assignments.Assignment and implement Assignment, but the repo has no dependency/build manifest or local Assignment interface. Decide whether to add a minimal build scaffold/dependency source, remove the interface coupling for archive examples, or document that these files require an external GenSpark harness."}, {"title": "Fix leetCode/ValidBrackets.java Java class/file-name mismatch", "details": "javac fails because leetCode/ValidBrackets.java declares public class algo. Rename the public class to ValidBrackets, make it non-public, or rename the file to algo.java depending on intended usage."}, {"title": "Add archive-focused local verification docs for algos", "details": "Since this is not an app candidate, add a root README or update DEVELOPMENT_PLAN.md with the safe verification commands used here: Python ast syntax check and per-file javac-to-tempdir compile check, plus known Java dependency exceptions."}], "repo_clean_after_checks": true, "worker_session_id": "20260606_020247_a0fda1"}',NULL);
