kend entrypoint.", "No package.json, vercel.json, requirements.txt, pyproject.toml, Procfile, runtime.txt, app.py, main.py, or manage.py present.", "Existing VERCEL_TRIAGE tracker lists api.requests under script/archive folders that are not Vercel app candidates as-is."], "recommended_next_validation_path": ["Do not prioritize for Vercel app deployment as-is.", "If productizing, first inventory each script''s credential/env assumptions and remove/parameterize any literal secrets or private data.", "Pick one highest-value utility and wrap it with requirements, tests, safe .env.example, and either a small dashboard/API or CLI docs before deployment review."], "worker_session_id": "20260606_020247_282923"}',NULL);
